    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When an ally you can see within 60 feet of yourself expends Heroic Inspiration, you can gain Heroic Inspiration if you lack it. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-weTZe1Tt1v7CJJWZ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Tick Heroic Inspiration on your sheet.</p></section>",
